FORMAT: 1A
HOST: http://itas.apiary.io/
VERSION: 1.1

# ED&FMan Custom API v1.7

## Disclaimer

**** Warning: at this point, ITAS API does not support asynchronous or multithreading calls for POST, PUT, PATCH and DELETE requests. Async or multithreading requests could result in various Error messages, or even a corruption of data in extreme cases and are therefore not supported. ****
<br />
<br />
<strong>Release notes</strong> (<sup>5th</sup> October 2026.)

## New Endpoints

<ul>
<li>Inventory <b>Lots Create</b>: Create Lots,<a href="/#reference/inventory/lots-create/create-lots"> Link</a></li>
<li>Inventory <b>Lots Update</b>: Update Lots,<a href="/#reference/inventory/lots-update/update-lots"> Link</a></li>
<li>Inventory <b>Lots Delete</b>: Delete Lots,<a href="/#reference/inventory/lots-delete/delete-lots"> Link</a></li>
</ul>

## Updated Endpoints

<ul>
<li>None</li>
</ul>
<div>** ends ** </div>


## AccessToken [/AT]
