# Group Contract-Physical

## Net and Gross Weights Update [/Contracts/{TradingEntityId}/Traffic/NetAndGrossWeights/{PhysicalTradeId}]

### Update Net and Gross Weights [PATCH]
`PATCH` Adjust Net and Gross Weights. * <a href="/#introduction/disclaimer"> (Disclaimer)</a>

|Property|Description|Type|Max Length|Notes|Constraint|
|--------|-----------|----|----------|-----|----------|
|PhysicalTradeId|Physical Trade Id|`string`|10||Required|
|GrossWeight|Gross Weight|`decimal`|||Required|
|NetWeight|Net Weight|`decimal`|||Required|

+ Request (application/json)
    + Header

            Authorization: Bearer eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..JgPGxt0Ok5baKx0YMXlO6D9kUYrCWM-Kma9b9iMW8tg

    + Attributes (NetGrossWeight Update)

+ Parameters
    + TradingEntityId (required, string, `JT`) ... Identify specific trading entity.
    + PhysicalTradeId (required, string, `P00001.000`) ... Code for Physical Trade to update.

+ Response 200 (application/json; charset=utf-8)
    + Attributes 
        + Data (array [NetGrossWeight ResponseP, NetGrossWeight ResponseS])
        + Response (200 UpdateResponse)
    
+ Response 400 (application/json; charset=utf-8)
    + Attributes (400 Response)

+ Response 404 (application/json; charset=utf-8)
    + Attributes (404 Response)

+ Response 405 (application/json; charset=utf-8)
    + Attributes (405 Response)


# Group Electronic Order Book

## Broker Data Create [/ElectronicOrderBook/BrokerData]

### Create Broker Data [POST]
`POST`

|Property|Description|Type|Max Length|Notes|Constraint|
|--------|-----------|----|----------|-----|----------|
|OrderId|Order Id|`number`|||Required|
|SerialNo|Serail Number|`number`||||
|TradeDate|Trade Date|`datetime`||||
|AccountCode|Account Code|`string`|10|||
|TradeCodeId|Trade Code ID|`string`|3|||
|DepartmentCode|Department Code|`string`|4|||
|InstrumentCode|Instrument Code|`string`|8|||
|PromptDate|Prompt Date|`date`||`yyyy-mm` or `yyyy-mm-dd`||
|Instruction|Instruction|`boolean`||||
|OptionType|Option Type|`string`|1|`Call`, `Put` or `Futures`||
|OptionSeries|Option Series|`decimal`||||
|BuySell|Buy or Sell|`string`|4|`Buy` or `Sell`||
|Lots|Lots|`number`||. Greater than `0`||
|PhysiscalTradeCode|Physical Reference|`string`|11|||
|BrokerCode|Broker Account|`string`|10|||
|Price|Price|`decimal`||||
|FloorBrokerCode|Floor Broker Account Code|`string`|10|||
|TraderCode|Trader Code|`string`|3|||
|Memo|Memorandum|`string`|120|||
|StrategyCode|Strategy Code|`string`|15|||
|StrategyGroupCode|Strategy Group Code|`string`|15|||
|Memo2|Memorandum 2|`string`|20|||
|ExternalSerial|External Serial|`string`|10|||
|CommissionCodeRateCode|Commission Code Rate Code|`string`|3|||
|BrokerPrice|Broker Price|`decimal`||||
|BuybackReference|Buyback Reference|`number`||||
|ClientOrBroker|Client or Broker|`string`||`Client` or `Broker`||
|CommissionCurrencyCode|Commission Currency Code|`string`|3|||
|CommissionType|Commission Type|`string`|1| `Percentage` or `RatePerLot`||
|CommissionRate|Commission Rate|`decimal`||||
|CounterpartyCode|Counterparty Code|`string`|10|||
|DeclaredPrice|Declared Price|`decimal`||||
|ExchangeCode|Exchange Code|`string`|6|||
|InventoryHedgeType|Inventory Hedge Type|`string`|1|||
|IsPhysicalFix|Is Physical Fix|`boolean`||||
|OTCBrokerCode|OTC Broker Code|`string`|10|||
|OTCBrokerCommissionCurrencyCode|OTC Broker Commission Currency|`string`|3|||
|OTCCommission|OTC Commission|`decimal`||||
|SecondBrokerCommissionCurrencyCode|Second Broker Commission Currency|`string`|3|||
|TradeTime|Trade Time|`string`|5|`HH:MM`||
|TradingEntityId|Trading Entity ID|`string`|2|||


+ Request (application/json)
    + Header

            Authorization: Bearer eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..JgPGxt0Ok5baKx0YMXlO6D9kUYrCWM-Kma9b9iMW8tg

    + Attributes (BrokerDataCreate)

+ Response 201 (application/json; charset=utf-8)
    + Attributes 
        + Data
            + BrokerDataId: 1 (number)
            + OrderId: 1 (number)
        + Response (201 CreateResponse)
    
+ Response 400 (application/json; charset=utf-8)
    + Attributes (400 Response)

+ Response 404 (application/json; charset=utf-8)
    + Attributes (404 Response)

+ Response 405 (application/json; charset=utf-8)
    + Attributes (405 Response)

